{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a7c3e1d0-4b92-4f18-9e6a-0c1d2e3f4a5b",
    "name": "Digital Store Core",
    "description": "REST API ядра магазина цифровых товаров (GGSel-like).\n\nПоток: витрина → создать заказ по SKU → вебхук оплаты → авто-выдача кода.\n\nСтатусы заказа: `created` → `paid` → `fulfilling` → `delivered` | `failed`.\n\nКод (`code`) отдаётся только в статусе `delivered`.\n\n## Импорт\n1. Postman → Import → этот файл.\n2. Выберите окружение **Digital Store Core — local** (`docs/local.postman_environment.json`) или оставьте переменные коллекции.\n3. `php artisan serve` (по умолчанию `http://127.0.0.1:8000`).\n\n## Переменные\n| Имя | Назначение |\n|---|---|\n| `baseUrl` | Базовый URL без `/api` |\n| `sku` | SKU из сида, по умолчанию `STEAM-TOPUP-500` (1499¢) |\n| `orderId` | UUID заказа (заполняется тестом после Create) |\n| `amountCents` | Сумма заказа (заполняется после Create) |\n| `eventId` | Идемпотентный id события оплаты |\n| `webhookSecret` | `PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SECRET`; пусто = подпись не нужна |\n\nПапка **Happy path** рассчитана на Collection Runner: Create → Pay → Get.\n\nПовтор вебхука с тем же `event_id`: HTTP 200, `{ ok: true, duplicate: true }`, без второй выдачи.\nОпционально `X-Signature: HMAC-SHA256(raw body, webhookSecret)` — скрипт папки Webhooks ставит заголовок сам, если секрет задан.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000" },
    { "key": "sku", "value": "STEAM-TOPUP-500" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "amount", "value": "500" },
    { "key": "eventId", "value": "evt-demo-1" },
    { "key": "webhookSecret", "value": "" },
    { "key": "category", "value": "steam" },
    { "key": "limit", "value": "50" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Happy path",
      "description": "Прогон в Collection Runner по порядку: создать заказ, оплатить, получить код.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Create order",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('created, без кода', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('created');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.code).to.eql(null);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', body.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('amount', String(body.amount));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('eventId', 'evt-' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sku\": \"{{sku}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
            "description": "`POST /api/orders` — заказ в `created`. Сид: `STEAM-TOPUP-500` (1499), `PSN-20-EUR` (2000)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 created",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"sku\": \"STEAM-TOPUP-500\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders"
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"9f1c2a3b-4d5e-6789-abcd-ef0123456789\",\n  \"sku\": \"STEAM-TOPUP-500\",\n  \"status\": \"created\",\n  \"amount_cents\": 1499,\n  \"code\": null,\n  \"provider\": null,\n  \"failure_reason\": null,\n  \"paid_at\": null,\n  \"delivered_at\": null,\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-04T08:00:00+00:00\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Pay webhook",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('eventId')) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('eventId', 'evt-' + Date.now());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('ok, не duplicate', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.ok).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.duplicate).to.eql(false);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event_id\": \"{{eventId}}\",\n  \"order_id\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"status\": \"paid\",\n  \"amount\": {{amount}},\n  \"currency\": \"RUB\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2025-01-01T12:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/payment",
            "description": "`POST /api/webhooks/payment`. `amount_cents` должен совпасть с заказом. При `QUEUE_CONNECTION=sync` выдача происходит в этом же запросе."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 paid",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"event_id\": \"evt-123\",\n  \"order_id\": \"9f1c2a3b-4d5e-6789-abcd-ef0123456789\",\n  \"status\": \"paid\",\n  \"amount\": 500,\n  \"currency\": \"RUB\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2025-01-01T12:00:00Z\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/payment"
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"duplicate\": false\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Get order (delivered)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('delivered + код', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('delivered');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.code).to.be.a('string').and.to.have.lengthOf.at.least(1);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.provider).to.be.oneOf(['a', 'b']);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}",
            "description": "`GET /api/orders/{id}`. После успешной оплаты и выдачи — `code` и `provider`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 delivered",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}"
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"9f1c2a3b-4d5e-6789-abcd-ef0123456789\",\n  \"sku\": \"STEAM-TOPUP-500\",\n  \"status\": \"delivered\",\n  \"amount_cents\": 1499,\n  \"code\": \"A-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX\",\n  \"provider\": \"a\",\n  \"failure_reason\": null,\n  \"paid_at\": \"2026-09-04T08:00:01+00:00\",\n  \"delivered_at\": \"2026-09-04T08:00:01+00:00\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-04T08:00:00+00:00\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
